#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:5
msgid "FuelAxFlow — Gestión de carburante"
msgstr "FuelAxFlow — Fuel Management"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:7
msgid ""
"FuelAxFlow: aplicación de gestión de carburante para los sectores forestal, "
"obra pública, minero y transporte. Multi-depósito, instalación local, sin "
"dependencia de internet."
msgstr ""
"FuelAxFlow: fuel management application for the forestry, construction, "
"mining and transport sectors. Multi-depot, local installation, no internet "
"dependency."

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:18
msgid "Gestión de carburante para forestal, obra pública, minería y transporte"
msgstr "Fuel management for forestry, construction, mining and transport"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:19
msgid "Instalación local · Multi-depósito · Sin dependencia de internet"
msgstr "Local installation · Multi-depot · No internet dependency"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:27
msgid "El carburante es el segundo coste de la explotación"
msgstr "Fuel is the second-largest operating cost"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:28
msgid ""
"Y suele ser el peor controlado. Depósitos repartidos entre bosque, fábrica y "
"estación, consumos anotados en papel, distribuciones a terceros sin registro "
"fiable y facturación que se reconstruye a fin de mes de memoria. FuelAxFlow "
"cierra ese circuito."
msgstr ""
"And usually the worst controlled one. Depots scattered across the forest, "
"the mill and the station, consumption logged on paper, third-party "
"distributions with no reliable record, and invoicing reconstructed from "
"memory at month's end. FuelAxFlow closes that loop."

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:30
msgid "Qué cubre"
msgstr "What it covers"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:32
msgid ""
"<b>Stock multi-depósito</b>: central, bosque, fábrica, estación y tránsito, "
"con alertas de nivel bajo"
msgstr ""
"<b>Multi-depot stock</b>: central, forest, mill, station and transit, with "
"low-level alerts"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:33
msgid "<b>Circuito de compra</b>: pedidos, recepciones y facturas de proveedor"
msgstr "<b>Purchase workflow</b>: orders, receipts and supplier invoices"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:34
msgid ""
"<b>Consumos</b> por equipo y contador, con imputación analítica por centro "
"de coste"
msgstr ""
"<b>Consumption</b> by equipment and meter, with cost-center allocation"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:35
msgid ""
"<b>Transferencias entre depósitos</b>, con control de las diferencias en "
"tránsito"
msgstr ""
"<b>Transfers between depots</b>, with in-transit variance control"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:36
msgid ""
"<b>Distribución a terceros</b> y prefacturación de transportistas y clientes"
msgstr ""
"<b>Third-party distribution</b> and pre-invoicing for carriers and clients"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:37
msgid "<b>Cuadros de mando</b> y perfiles de usuario por función"
msgstr "<b>Dashboards</b> and role-based user profiles"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:42
msgid "Cuadro de mando de existencias de FuelAxFlow"
msgstr "FuelAxFlow stock dashboard"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:44
msgid "Cuadro de mando de existencias por depósito"
msgstr "Stock dashboard by depot"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:47
msgid "Instalación local, no en la nube"
msgstr "Local installation, not in the cloud"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:48
msgid ""
"FuelAxFlow se instala en los servidores de la empresa. Los datos no salen de "
"sus instalaciones y el sistema sigue funcionando aunque la conexión falle, "
"que en un sitio forestal es la norma y no la excepción. Existe además acceso "
"móvil para la captura en campo."
msgstr ""
"FuelAxFlow is installed on the company's own servers. Data never leaves the "
"premises, and the system keeps working even if the connection drops — the "
"norm rather than the exception on a forestry site. Mobile access is also "
"available for field data entry."

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:50
msgid "Estado actual"
msgstr "Current status"

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:51
msgid ""
"FuelAxFlow se encuentra en <b>despliegue piloto</b> en la República del "
"Congo y en Camerún, sobre instalación local en servidores del cliente. "
"Estamos abiertos a incorporar nuevas empresas al programa piloto en "
"condiciones preferentes."
msgstr ""
"FuelAxFlow is currently in <b>pilot deployment</b> in the Republic of Congo "
"and Cameroon, on local installations on the client's own servers. We are "
"open to bringing new companies into the pilot program on preferential "
"terms."

#: templates/core/fuelaxflow.html:53
msgid "Solicitar una demostración"
msgstr "Request a demo"

#: templates/core/home.html:4
msgid "Software de Gestión y Trazabilidad Forestal"
msgstr "Forestry Management and Traceability Software"

#: templates/core/home.html:7
msgid ""
"Software de gestión y trazabilidad forestal: GPS por tronco, de la "
"prospección al embarque. Conformidad EUDR. En producción desde 1997 en "
"concesiones certificadas OLB de República del Congo y Camerún."
msgstr ""
"Forestry management and traceability software: GPS per log, from "
"prospecting to shipping. EUDR compliance. In production since 1997 in OLB "
"certified concessions in the Republic of Congo and Cameroon."

#: templates/core/home.html:30
msgid "Trazabilidad forestal, del bosque al embarque"
msgstr "Forestry traceability, from the forest to the shipment"

#: templates/core/home.html:33
msgid ""
"Suite de gestión para la industria forestal · Trazabilidad GPS por tronco · "
"Conformidad EUDR"
msgstr ""
"Management suite for the forestry industry · GPS traceability per log · "
"EUDR compliance"

#: templates/core/home.html:34
msgid ""
"Desarrollando software forestal desde 1997 · En producción en concesiones "
"certificadas OLB de República del Congo y Camerún"
msgstr ""
"Developing forestry software since 1997 · In production in OLB certified "
"concessions in the Republic of Congo and Cameroon"

#: templates/core/home.html:38
msgid "Hablemos de su trazabilidad EUDR"
msgstr "Let's talk about your EUDR traceability"

#: templates/core/home.html:51
msgid "Diciembre de 2026: la fecha ya está fijada"
msgstr "December 2026: the deadline is already set"

#: templates/core/home.html:53
msgid ""
"El Reglamento europeo contra la deforestación (<b>EUDR</b>) se aplica desde "
"el <b>30 de diciembre de 2026</b> a medianas y grandes empresas, y desde el "
"<b>30 de junio de 2027</b> a micro y pequeñas empresas. Exige "
"geolocalización de la parcela de origen, evaluación de riesgos y declaración "
"de diligencia debida para poder comercializar madera en la Unión Europea."
msgstr ""
"The European Union Deforestation Regulation (<b>EUDR</b>) applies from "
"<b>30 December 2026</b> for medium and large companies, and from <b>30 June "
"2027</b> for micro and small companies. It requires geolocation of the plot "
"of origin, risk assessment and a due diligence statement in order to place "
"timber on the EU market."

#: templates/core/home.html:55
msgid ""
"No es solo Europa. Estados Unidos exige declaración de especie y origen bajo "
"la <b>Lacey Act</b>, y la ley forestal china prohíbe la compra y el "
"transporte de madera de origen ilegal. Los tres mercados piden esencialmente "
"el mismo dato: <b>de dónde salió este tronco y con qué permiso</b>."
msgstr ""
"It's not just Europe. The United States requires species and origin "
"declarations under the <b>Lacey Act</b>, and China's forestry law bans the "
"purchase and transport of illegally sourced timber. All three markets "
"essentially ask for the same thing: <b>where this log came from and under "
"what permit</b>."

#: templates/core/home.html:57
msgid ""
"La trazabilidad no se improvisa en unos meses. O el dato se captura desde el "
"bosque, o no existe."
msgstr ""
"Traceability can't be improvised in a few months. Either the data is "
"captured from the forest, or it doesn't exist."

#: templates/core/home.html:67
msgid "Una sola cadena de datos, sin rupturas"
msgstr "One single data chain, with no gaps"

#: templates/core/home.html:68
msgid ""
"Cada tronco vinculado a su UFA, su parcela y su punto GPS, desde el "
"inventario hasta el contenedor."
msgstr ""
"Every log linked to its forest management unit, its plot and its GPS "
"point, from inventory to container."

#: templates/core/home.html:76
msgid "Prospección"
msgstr "Prospecting"

#: templates/core/home.html:77
msgid "Inventario de campo, UFA, AAC, parcelas. Importación GPS y QGIS."
msgstr ""
"Field inventory, forest management units, annual cutting areas, plots. GPS "
"and QGIS import."

#: templates/core/home.html:84
msgid "Explotación"
msgstr "Logging"

#: templates/core/home.html:85
msgid "Apeo, arrastre, preparación de parque, transporte y CITES."
msgstr "Felling, skidding, yard preparation, transport and CITES."

